Please review

Also change some objects to classes so that they are not taking up memory for the lifetime of the application.
The custom data is key value pairs, they will be available through the referenced manga or chapter object as normal json key values
For example if you added reader mode(with the key juiReaderMode) such as webtoon to a manga object, this is what will show up when you request that manga from the api again
```json
{
    "id": 10,
    "title": "Isekai manga",
    "meta": {
        "juiReaderMode": "webtoon"
    }
}
```
